# Sapphire Framework Patterns

## Commands

- Extend `ExtendedCommand` (custom base class) not `Command` directly
- Use `@ApplyOptions<ExtendedCommand.Options>()` decorator for configuration
- Override `registerApplicationCommands()` to register slash commands
- Use `override` keyword on all overridden methods

```typescript
@ApplyOptions<ExtendedCommand.Options>({
  description: "Command description"
})
export class PingCommand extends ExtendedCommand {
  override registerApplicationCommands(registry: ApplicationCommandRegistry) {
    registry.registerChatInputCommand((builder) =>
      builder.setName('ping').setDescription(this.description)
    );
  }

  override async chatInputRun(interaction: ChatInputCommand.Interaction<'cached'>) {
    // Command logic
  }
}
```

## Listeners

- Extend `Listener<typeof Events.EventName>` with specific event type
- Use `@ApplyOptions<Listener.Options>({ once: true })` for one-time listeners
- Use `override run()` method

```typescript
@ApplyOptions<Listener.Options>({ once: true })
export class ClientReadyListener extends Listener<typeof Events.ClientReady> {
  override async run() {
    // Listener logic
  }
}
```

## Preconditions

- Extend `Precondition` class
- Return `this.ok()` for success or `this.error()` for failure
- Use `context` parameter for passing data

```typescript
export class CachedGuildOnlyPrecondition extends Precondition {
  override async chatInputRun(interaction: Command.ChatInputCommandInteraction) {
    if (interaction.inCachedGuild()) {
      return this.ok();
    }
    return this.error({ message: 'This command can only be used in a server' });
  }
}
```

## Container Access

- Access dependencies via `this.container` (logger, config, prisma)
- Container is typed via module augmentation in `global.d.ts`

## Discord UI Helpers

Use the project's utility functions, NOT raw Discord.js builders directly:

### Embeds
```typescript
import { primaryEmbed, baseEmbed, successEmbed, errorEmbed } from '#utils/discord/embed';

primaryEmbed();                           // Embed with primary color
baseEmbed(title, description, color);     // Base embed builder
successEmbed('Message saved!');             // ✅ Success embed
errorEmbed('Something went wrong');         // ❌ Error embed
```

### Components
```typescript
import { button, selectMenu, modal } from '#utils/discord/actionRow';

button({ label: 'Click', style: ButtonStyle.Primary, customId: 'btn' });
selectMenu('string', { placeholder: 'Select', options: [...] });
modal('My Modal', 'modal-id', { label: 'Name', customId: 'name', style: TextInputStyle.Short });
```

### Interaction Types
- Prefer cached guild interactions: `ChatInputCommand.Interaction<'cached'>`
